        ))}
      </div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="msg-wrap">
      <div class="msg-indent">
        <p class="msg-p" data-msg-rv>I want more dates with you, langga. More city dates, more random laag, more overnight stays, more laughter sa atong room, more pictures, more stories, and more memories nga kita ra ang nakahibalo sa meaning. I want to experience more of life with you, not because I need everything to be perfect, but because life feels more beautiful when I get to share it with you.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

