      <div class="msg-chh"><span class="msg-chh__l"><span class="msg-num" aria-hidden="true">12</span><span class="msg-mono msg-rose">Salamat</span></span><span class="msg-mono msg-muted">Daghang salamat</span></div>
      <div class="msg-cascade" data-msg-cascade>
        {THANKS.map((t) => (
          <p class="msg-disp msg-cas" style={`padding-left:${t.pad}`}><em class="msg-rose">{t.a}</em> {t.b}</p>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="msg-indent">
        <p class="msg-p" data-msg-rv>Thank you for being part of my life, langga. Thank you for the love you give me, for the time you spend with me, and for all the memories we've already made. Thank you for making me feel loved in ways nga usahay dili nako ma-explain. I'm happy nga ikaw akong kauban sa mga moments nga sauna gipangandoy ra nato. And I'm excited for all the things we haven't experienced yet.</p>
        <p class="msg-p" data-msg-rv>I know we still have a lot to learn about each other. Naa pa tay mga weaknesses, misunderstandings, and things we need to improve. But I hope we keep choosing to understand each other rather than letting our problems push us away. I don't expect us to be perfect, langga. I just want us to keep growing, keep trying, and keep loving each other in ways that make us both feel safe and happy.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
