        <p class="msg-p" data-msg-rv>I'm sorry for the times nga nasakitan tika, langga. I love you for all that you are, and I appreciate everything you bring into my life. I don't want to love you only when it's easy. I want to keep learning how to love you even when things are hard.</p>
      </div>
